      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Why do we still need mesh read/write enabled in the first place?\n\nWe have server side bundle scanning now, all this is doing is wasting memory where it doesn't need to be anymore by storing the mesh in the ram as well as VRAM.\n\nIs there a genuine reason for this requirement to persist?",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
