  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "At the moment, people cannot realize that Read/Write Mesh disabled cause massive amount of Triangles count happen.\n\nCan you make it into 1 message than 2 separate message which people never thought it is related?\n\nAlso as opinion:\n\nChange message on unusual Triangles detection (swap to more suitable message or warning to ask user to check)",
